   "html": "<p>We partnered with Starline Tours to bring guests into the seedy Hollywood world of Cliff Booth through a custom mis-adventures bus tour that blended historical storytelling and unexpected surprises.</p><p>The tour offered a unique and compelling perspective of Cliff Booth’s world ahead of the film’s premiere. Guests experienced a mix of behind-the-scenes Hollywood insights and visual moments designed for capture, with a mid-way F&amp;B stop at a local tiki bar.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "THE VEHICLE",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "We transformed a 21-passenger and two 27-passenger Starline Tour buses into rolling tributes to the film’s ’70s-era world, carrying its look and feel onto the streets of Hollywood. Retro graphics wrapped every side of the buses, with title treatment and logos across the exterior.&nbsp;",
     "right": "Each seat featured a custom cover, with the film’s title treatment on every other one. Bright vinyl wraps and decorative side skirting carried the look throughout the interiors, while fuzzy dice and a dashboard hula girl added era-inspired finishing touches."
    },
