  {
   "title": "TIKI TAKEOVER",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Guests got to experience one of the locations up close with a pit stop to The Lucky Tiki in West Hollywood during the afternoon tour. The Lucky Tiki stop began with Mai Tais at the welcome bar, giving guests a lively first taste of the experience. Inside, mirror decals, props, and in-period memorabilia added character to the experience. The patio extended the experience outdoors, with more memorabilia and props bringing the film’s world to life. Posters from films that inspired the movie, alongside other Quentin Tarantino titles, highlighted additional cinematic influences.</p>"
    },
